    "Real projects, shipped. Each one plays, because a still can't show feel.",
    'var(--leading-body)',
    'var(--tracking-normal)',
  ],
  [
    'body-lg',
    'One senior team. AI handles the volume. People handle the feel.',
    'var(--leading-body)',
    'var(--tracking-normal)',
  ],
